摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH execution-discipline plugin suite: 11 plugins + 6 skills, zero dependencies, 426 tests. 让 DeepSeek Harness 变聪明的插件套件。","id":"gh:1335156872","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"cleverer-dsh","slug":"Classicoke/cleverer-dsh","topics":["agent-skills","ai-agents","cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH execution-discipline plugin suite: 11 plugins + 6 skills, zero dependencies, 426 tests. 让 DeepSe"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ek Harness 变聪明的插件套件。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# cleverer-dsh"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A plugin suite that makes DeepSeek Harness (DSH) actually smart — execution discipline, practical to"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ols, and a skill library, installed in one shot."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## ✨ Feature Highlights"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Icon | Feature |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| ⚡ | **Faster & cheaper (measured)**: same task vs bare DSH — **49% faster**, 44% fewer estimated t"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"okens (small sample, not yet broadly tested) |\n| 🧠 | **Execution discipline**: automatic failure int"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"erception, forced reflection, task-planning reminders, memory dedup, experience auto-distilled into "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"skills |\n| 🛠️ | **Ready-made tools**: instant multi-directory file lookup + 9-point environment heal"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"th check — stop guessing |\n| 📦 | **One-command install/uninstall** via DSH's own plugin manager |\n| "},{"id":"p7s6","text":"🧪 | **478 unit tests green**, statement & line coverage 100%; pure code, **zero dependencies**, neve"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"r touches DSH itself |\n| 📚 | **6 built-in skills**: 6-step error handling, error lookup table, fast "},{"id":"p7s8","text":"file lookup, root-cause debugging, local-first, plan-before-execute |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Measured results"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"We ran the same real task (analyzing a software packaging log) on **DSH with this suite** vs a **bar"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"e DSH** (nothing installed):"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Metric | With suite | Bare DSH | Diff |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| **Total time** | 8.6 min | 12.8 min | **49% faster** |\n| LLM calls | 51 | 61 | -20% |\n| Tool calls"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" | 59 | 67 | -14% |\n| **Estimated total tokens** | ~41,000 | ~73,000 | **44% fewer** |\n| Reasoning c"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"hunks | 401 | 1,163 | -65% |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**What you notice in practice**: with the suite, the agent stops retrying the same broken approach ("},{"id":"p12s2","text":"it automatically switches), distills working commands into reusable scripts, and asks you before act"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ing at key decision points. Bare DSH retried the same problem 13 times, never distilled anything, an"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"d never consulted you."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"> ⚠️ **Disclaimer**: n=1 per group; tokens are character-estimated (±20%); **not broadly tested yet*"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"* — the direction is evidenced, exact numbers await more samples and real API billing data."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## What it fixes"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"DSH is full-featured but **not smart by default**: empty system prompt, stubborn retries on failure,"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" skills installed but never used, todo tool ignored. This suite fixes it:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Layer | What it does |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| **Discipline layer** (8 plugins) | failure interception, forced reflection, task planning, memory "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"dedup |\n| **Hub** (discipline-hub) | shared failure log + reminder throttling — plugins don't collid"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"e, issues are traceable |\n| **Tools layer** (2 plugins) | instant file lookup, env health check |\n| "},{"id":"p17s4","text":"**Skill layer** (6 skills) | on-demand auto-loading — know what to do on errors, find things fast |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Installed via Option 1 (plugin manager) — all plugins in one inline patch"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Installed via Option 2 (script install) — grouped into boards"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The board layout makes plugin cooperation structural: the discipline group shares the hub's unified "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"failure log and reminder pipeline, working as one suite instead of in isolation."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"**Prerequisites**: DSH installed and initialized; `pnpm` available (DSH's plugin manager)."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"**Choose before you install** — the two options differ in how plugins are organized:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| | Option 1: plugin manager (official) | Option 2: script install |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Command | `dsh plugin add ...` | paste one PowerShell line |\n| Plugin organization | all plugins i"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"n one inline config | grouped into `discipline-board` (discipline) + `tools-board` (tools) boards |\n"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"| Plugin cooperation | plugins work independently | **stronger** — discipline plugins share one fail"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"ure log & reminder pipeline, working as one suite |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"> 💡 **Why boards are the better architecture**: the plugins are not meant to work in isolation — one"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" traces the root cause, one distills the lesson, one reminds you to plan. Boards make this cooperati"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"on a **structural guarantee** (plugins belong to the same group and share the same facilities by con"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"struction) instead of leaving it to chance. Discipline and tools are physically separated with clear"},{"id":"p29s5","text":" boundaries, so adding your own plugin later has an obvious home; groups start/stop as a whole, whic"},{"id":"p29s6","text":"h makes upgrades and troubleshooting simpler."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### Option 1: via DSH's plugin manager (official)"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"No build step — plugins and skills are ready as soon as the command finishes. Uninstall:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"### Option 2: one-command script (PowerShell 7+)"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Paste this into PowerShell (auto-downloads the release zip → extracts → installs → cleans up):"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"> ⚠️ **Pick ONE install method.** Installing both applies every plugin twice (duplicated behavior, p"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"remature denials). Uninstall one before switching to the other."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"#### Uninstall (Option 2)"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"All deletions are scoped to `$HOME\\.dsh` (your own user directory, never a system path), and only th"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"e files listed above are touched."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## Plugins"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"| Plugin | Problem it solves | When it triggers |"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"| `anti-stuck` | stubbornly retrying the same failing command | ≥2 same-arg fails → deny; ≥3 turn fa"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"ils → remind; ≥5 → force reflection |\n| `dsh-env-triage` | param-tweaking loops, going in circles | "},{"id":"p43s3","text":"≥2 schemes fail → trace card; ≥3 → stop & report |\n| `dsh-plan-discipline` | todo tool ignored | mul"},{"id":"p43s4","text":"ti-step task without plan → remind; ≥3 fails & stale plan → refresh |\n| `dsh-memory` | memory bloat,"},{"id":"p43s5","text":" force-write abuse | dedup before write + 60s window dedup |\n| `skill-evolver` | junk skills being s"},{"id":"p43s6","text":"aved | generalization gate before persisting |\n| `dsh-discipline` | empty system prompt | injects 11"},{"id":"p43s7","text":" execution rules every turn |\n| `dsh-skill-loader` | skills installed but never used | available-ski"},{"id":"p43s8","text":"lls reminder at task start + keyword summoning |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"- Verified on **Windows + PowerShell** only; Linux/macOS untested (plugins are cross-platform, insta"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"ll scripts are PowerShell)\n- Never modifies DSH source code; only config injection and skill injecti"},{"id":"p45s3","text":"on\n- Headless mode: some features limited (no web server → some web-dependent features skipped)"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
